-SIZE: 11pt\">◈ 강좌기간 : </span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2013.5.13.(월)~5.31.(금) (5.31일자 시험-반드시 응시해야함)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">◈ 강좌일시 : 18시 ~ 21시(시험시간 18시~22시)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">◈ 강좌내용</span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"27\" valign=\"center\" width=\"210\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">강좌</span></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"27\" valign=\"center\" width=\"176\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">S/W Version</span></span></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt do